{"id":421568,"title":"番外四｜知识总结：这门课的全部思维导图","content":"<p>你好，我是王喆。</p><p>我们这门课程已经接近尾声了，为了加深你的理解和记忆，也为了方便你回顾学习，我把这门课的核心知识点总结成了几张思维导图。你可以对照着这些图片，把这门课的内容从头到尾梳理一遍。回望来路，相信你会有更多新的体会和思考。<br>\n<img src=\"./images/421568_1.jpg\" alt=\"\"><br>\n<img src=\"./images/421568_2.jpg\" alt=\"\"><br>\n<img src=\"./images/421568_3.jpg\" alt=\"\"><br>\n<img src=\"./images/421568_4.jpg\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"./images/421568_5.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p><!-- [[[read_end]]] -->","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":313447,"user_name":"小巫debug日记","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1056037,"ip_address":"","ucode":"B35E2CF1B3B04E","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/1d/25/fd8a6cf8.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1632446868,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":113580,"content":"是这样，学习只是万里长征第一步，一定要坚持实践，否则学这些知识毫无用处。加油！","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"王喆","uid":1662192,"ctime":1632528415,"ip_address":"","comment_id":313447,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100083301,"comment_content":"非常棒的课程，投资是一门学问，理论和实践都很重要，希望能通过学习赚到自己的第一桶金","like_count":8,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1662192,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/19/5c/f0/46214d29.jpg","nickname":"王喆","note":"","ucode":"2EDC616F905F3F","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":527355,"discussion_content":"是这样，学习只是万里长征第一步，一定要坚持实践，否则学这些知识毫无用处。加油！","content_length":39,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1632528415,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":313438,"user_name":"进化菌","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1276861,"ip_address":"","ucode":"B30A5F78BB4